{"lyrics":"[Intro]\n[00:00.00](\n[00:02.66]Enviyon on the mix\n[00:11.66])\n[Verse 1]\n[00:11.74]I don't know what's up with me, shit\n[00:13.02]I've been coolin' for the weekend\n[00:14.60]I've been chillin' with my niggas, yeah, my bros\n[00:16.72]And I've been ballin' I've been swishin'\n[00:19.06]I've been ballin', I've been swishin'\n[00:20.50]I've been ballin' 'til they call me Amber Rose\n[00:23.36]And how come everybody hate it when they see me doin' greater?\n[00:26.46]They can't wait for me to trip, I never fall (Fall)\n[00:29.36]And if it's one thing that my momma told me that I'm gon' remember is I'm better than these niggas and these hoes\n[00:34.84]I gotta let 'em know, I gotta let 'em know\n[00:40.74]I gotta let 'em know, I gotta let 'em know, yeah\n[Verse 2]\n[00:47.24]It's that rockstar status, yeah, money, gotta have it, yeah, I just gotta get it on my own\n[00:53.04]I want a beach house party, yeah, drivin' a Ferrari, yeah, and I wanna buy my mom a home\n[00:58.98]And I don't wanna fall in love, no, just to end up heart broke, I know I'ma always be alone\n[01:04.84]And baby, you know how the story goes, you know we been here before\n[01:08.28]So I guess I gotta let you go, I gotta let you go\n[Refrain]\n[01:13.34]I gotta let you go\n[01:16.32]I gotta let you go\n[01:17.18]I gotta let you go\n[Verse 3]\n[01:22.78]I'ma pull up in that new thing, feelin' like I'm Bruce Wayne\n[01:26.08]Yeah, I got more money than your man\n[01:28.48]So baby hop up in my new thing, put you on some new things, hopefully your man'll understand\n[01:33.88]That you just tryna have a good time, lookin' at the night sky, baby, I know you can feel the vibe\n[01:40.36]Yeah, you just tryna have a fun time, baby girl, you too fine\n[01:43.86]We can go wherever for the night, but only for the night\n[01:48.88]Yeah, only for the night, yeah, only for the night, yeah, only for the night\n[02:00.52]Yeah, yeah\n[Outro]\n[02:00.86]Feelin' like I'm Bruce Wayne\n[02:02.64]Yeah, I got m